=== Episode 4: Biscuits ===
For the signature bake, the bakers were given {{frac|1|1|2}} hours to make 12 biscuits of their choice; the biscuits should not be too soft, too hard or too crumbly. The technical challenge gave the bakers {{frac|1|1|2}} hours to bake 24 [[brandy snaps]]. For the showstopper, the bakers were asked to produce a macaron display, consisting of 120 macarons (60 pairs) in 3 different flavors; they had 5 hours to complete it. 
