=== Episode 5: Pies  ===
The signature challenge asked the bakers to produce a hearty family pie using either a [[Puff pastry#Variants and distinctions|rough puff]] or [[flaky pastry]], in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the technical challenge, the bakers were asked to bake a batch of 6 miniature [[pork pie]]s (using a [[hot water crust pastry]]) in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours, using Paul Hollywood's recipe. It was a 2-day bake challenge — to give the filling time to set overnight the pies were judged the next day. For the showstopper, the bakers were asked to bake a meringue pie — a fruit and/or custard pie topped with [[meringue]] — in {{frac|3|1|2}} hours. 
