=== Episode 8: Final ===
For their final signature bake, the finalists were asked to bake 12 [[mille-feuille]] in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the technical challenge, the bakers were asked to bake a [[sachertorte]] in 2 hours and 40 minutes. For their final showstopper, the bakers were asked to bake 3 different types of [[Petit four|petits fours]]: meringue, sweet pastry, and sponge-based, on the theme of British Summertime, within 4 hours. 
